B.btF=new A.j6("How do I update inventory stock?","Go to Inventory \u2192 tap any item to edit. Update the quantity and save. A low-stock alert shows when quantity falls below the minimum level.")
B.btG=new A.j6("How do I mark attendance?","Go to Staff \u2192 Attendance. Select today's date and tap each staff member to set their status (Present/Absent/Half Day/Late). Tap Save.")
